WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.120
The earliest event in the Chucky&nbsp;
timeline is September 1866 when&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:03.120 --> 00:00:06.240
the Hackensack Mayor’s House is built.&nbsp;
And then we don’t know anything&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:06.240 --> 00:00:10.080
that happened for another 93 years until&nbsp;
the birth of Charles Lee Ray on March 12th,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:10.080 --> 00:00:15.360
1959. We don’t see Chucky’s date of birth
anywhere so how do I know it occurs in 1959?

00:00:15.360 --> 00:00:19.120
To begin, this newspaper article states his&nbsp;
parents were killed on his 7th birthday.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:19.120 --> 00:00:23.280
This is confusing, because another article&nbsp;
states Ray Parents Slain, 8-year-old Charles&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:23.280 --> 00:00:27.440
Orphaned. That means one of these articles has&nbsp;
to be wrong. If we count the candles on his cake&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:27.440 --> 00:00:31.120
there are seven of them, and on the radio we&nbsp;
hear the killer is on the loose that same day.

00:00:31.120 --> 00:00:35.760
Let’s make an excuse for the filmmakers and just&nbsp;
say this article came out a year after the killing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:35.760 --> 00:00:40.560
took place. The Ray parents WERE slain. The now&nbsp;
8 year old Charles was orphaned. If we saw more&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:40.560 --> 00:00:45.440
of this text it would be something along the lines&nbsp;
of: “Police were called last night to 987 Sherwood&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:45.440 --> 00:00:49.040
Lane only to discover what must have been a&nbsp;
shocking display of murder in the mid-century&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:49.040 --> 00:00:53.120
modern home. That’s what the papers said one&nbsp;
year ago.” It’s not unheard of for journalists&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:53.120 --> 00:00:57.120
to do a follow up story on the anniversary&nbsp;
of an event, so let’s just go with that.

00:00:57.120 --> 00:00:58.560
This headline, from March 12th,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:58.560 --> 00:01:02.720
1965 mentions a Gruesome Double-Homicide.&nbsp;
This is most likely Charles’s parents,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:02.720 --> 00:01:07.600
so let’s just tentatively put 1965 down as the&nbsp;
year that Charles turns from 6 years old to 7.

00:01:07.600 --> 00:01:12.000
The other date we can fill in is in 1972, as&nbsp;
shown by the title text here, when Charles was&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:15.680
14 years old, as shown by the credits of&nbsp;
that episode. It doesn’t say if this scene&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:15.680 --> 00:01:19.920
takes place before or after his birthday that&nbsp;
year, but it must be after. So Charles started&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:19.920 --> 00:01:24.800
the year as 13 year old. We know he didn’t start&nbsp;
the year as a 14 year old and turn 15 that year,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:24.800 --> 00:01:28.720
because in order for that to be possible,&nbsp;
his seventh birthday would have been in 1964.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:28.720 --> 00:01:34.080
In th is shot in episode 1, it clearly shows&nbsp;
Charles and his mom both alive in 1965. That&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:34.080 --> 00:01:38.800
means his parents must have been killed on&nbsp;
his 7th birthday sometime after that in 1965.

00:01:38.800 --> 00:01:43.680
So we can fill in that he was 13 to begin the&nbsp;
year in 1972, and the rest of the calendar&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:43.680 --> 00:01:48.640
fills out cleanly, which leaves us with March&nbsp;
12th, 1959 as the year that Charles was born.

00:01:48.640 --> 00:01:51.200
If you want to know the date of&nbsp;
everything else in the franchise,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:51.200 --> 00:01:53.434
stick around to the end of this video.

00:01:53.434 --> 00:01:57.442
(metal music)

00:01:59.200 --> 00:02:03.920
It appears to be that same year, 1972, when&nbsp;
Charles leaves the Wayward Boys Home. The next&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:03.920 --> 00:02:09.360
known event is the birth of Andy Barclay on Nov&nbsp;
9th 1982. How do I know this? In Child’s Play 1,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:09.360 --> 00:02:12.880
we see Charles get killed in the early hours&nbsp;
of the morning, transfer his soul into Chucky,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:12.880 --> 00:02:16.240
and Chucky is given to Andy on his sixth&nbsp;
birthday. So Charles’ death day is the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:16.240 --> 00:02:20.320
same day as Andy’s birthday. In Bride&nbsp;
of Chucky and in Season 1 Episode 3,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:20.320 --> 00:02:24.560
we see that Charles died on November&nbsp;
9th, 1988. Subtract the 6 years of Andy’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:24.560 --> 00:02:28.800
life before meeting Chucky and you have&nbsp;
Andy’s date of birth: November 9th 1982.

00:02:28.800 --> 00:02:33.280
And yes, I’m aware of this file in Child’s&nbsp;
Play 2 that lists Andy’s birthday as January 4,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:33.280 --> 00:02:37.360
1983, but remember, this is just the toy&nbsp;
company’s file on him. It was the 80s,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:37.360 --> 00:02:41.120
they didn’t have the internet, they probably&nbsp;
just had bad info. We can throw that out.

00:02:41.120 --> 00:02:45.360
Then there’s the beginning of Charles’ crime&nbsp;
career in 1984, according to a newspaper seen in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:45.360 --> 00:02:50.400
Curse. This is assuming nobody ever found out that&nbsp;
he killed his Mom or the janitor at the orphanage.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:50.400 --> 00:02:54.320
This is probably the same year that he met Tiffany,&nbsp;
because we see them commit crimes together right away.

00:02:54.320 --> 00:02:59.440
Chucky and Tiffany get their Pontiac in 1987,&nbsp;
and move to Chicago shortly after in 1988.

00:02:59.440 --> 00:03:04.320
So then we have November 9th, 1988, the day that&nbsp;
Charles dies and transfers his soul into the doll,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:04.320 --> 00:03:08.240
which is also the day Nica is born, because we&nbsp;
see Charles go from his apartment with Tiffany&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:08.240 --> 00:03:12.160
to the room he’s keeping the pregnant Sarah&nbsp;
captive in to the toy store where he’s shot.

00:03:12.160 --> 00:03:15.840
And yes, I’m aware of this paper in Curse,&nbsp;
that claims Charles was killed the day&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:15.840 --> 00:03:20.640
before December 27th 1988. We know that the&nbsp;
tombstones and other newspapers are correct,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:20.640 --> 00:03:24.400
however, and this article is not, because&nbsp;
there are no Christmas decorations seen&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:24.400 --> 00:03:29.120
anywhere in the original Child’s Play. It was&nbsp;
just a typo, OK? A severe and continuous typo.

00:03:29.120 --> 00:03:30.960
And yes, I’m aware of this chart in Cult,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:30.960 --> 00:03:35.440
that claims Nica was born in ‘87 rather&nbsp;
than ‘88. This also has to be a typo,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:35.440 --> 00:03:38.880
because we literally see Nica being born&nbsp;
and it leads right into Child’s Play.

00:03:38.880 --> 00:03:42.480
So Child’s Play starts on November&nbsp;
9th, 1988, and takes place over a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:42.480 --> 00:03:46.000
few days. Eddie Caputo blows up on the&nbsp;
10th, Norris shoots Chucky on the 11th.

00:03:46.000 --> 00:03:51.600
On December 29, 1988 Andy gives an interview in&nbsp;
a tabloid newspaper. Then there’s Child’s Play 2,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:51.600 --> 00:03:54.400
all we know is that it takes&nbsp;
place in October of 1990,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:54.400 --> 00:03:58.240
based on the fact that Andy is slightly older,&nbsp;
and this calendar where the first of the month&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:58.240 --> 00:04:02.720
is on Monday. The only year in that vicinity&nbsp;
where October starts on a Monday is in 1990.

00:04:02.720 --> 00:04:07.280
Onto Child’s Play 3, Chucky finds Andy’s file in&nbsp;
a computer, and it states his present age is 16&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:07.280 --> 00:04:13.760
years old. If Andy turned 6 in November 1988, then&nbsp;
his 16th birthday is in November 1998. In Child’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:13.760 --> 00:04:18.800
Play 3 we see snow on the ground but it looks&nbsp;
like it’s melting as if it’s early Spring in 1999.

00:04:18.800 --> 00:04:21.950
In Bride of Chucky, Tiffany&nbsp;
reunites with Chucky and says,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:21.950 --> 00:04:25.179
– I know, it took me 10 years to find you.

00:04:25.179 --> 00:04:27.200
– This&nbsp;
would be not long after the 10 year mark from

00:04:27.200 --> 00:04:31.760
Chucky’s death, meaning that Bride of Chucky&nbsp;
probably takes place in Spring 1999 as well.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:31.760 --> 00:04:35.120
This checks out, because she would have found&nbsp;
out that Chucky was back shortly after he was&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:35.120 --> 00:04:38.640
shredded in the fan in Child’s Play 3.&nbsp;
She went straight to retrieve the pieces.

00:04:38.640 --> 00:04:42.640
There’s also a sticker on Jesse’s car in&nbsp;
Bride that says 12/98. Those stickers are&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:42.640 --> 00:04:47.360
usually valid for 6 months, so yeah, it’s more&nbsp;
evidence that we’re in the first half of 1999.

00:04:47.360 --> 00:04:51.680
There’s another time skip before Seed of Chucky.&nbsp;
The movie set scene takes place on March 18th,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:51.680 --> 00:04:54.640
2004, as seen on the date of&nbsp;
that day’s issue of Variety,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:54.640 --> 00:04:59.440
and the film takes place over a few days until the&nbsp;
21st. Then there’s an epilog scene 5 years later,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:59.440 --> 00:05:02.320
which is Glen and Glenda’s birthday&nbsp;
party. They were born on the final&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:02.320 --> 00:05:06.880
night of the main story of Seed, the&nbsp;
21st, so this is now March 21st 2009.

00:05:06.880 --> 00:05:10.880
We don’t actually see the date of Curse of Chucky&nbsp;
until the opening credits of the movie after:&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:10.880 --> 00:05:15.360
Cult of Chucky, where we found out that the little&nbsp;
girl who survived, Alice, was found on January 8,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:15.360 --> 00:05:19.280
2013. It doesn’t look all that cold out&nbsp;
in Curse, but maybe it was a warm winter.

00:05:19.280 --> 00:05:24.000
Nica was ruled insane in her trial a few months&nbsp;
later on April 7th, 2013. At some point after&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:24.000 --> 00:05:28.160
that, Chucky finds out how to split his soul up&nbsp;
into multiple dolls and sends one to attack Andy,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:28.160 --> 00:05:31.920
which Andy captures and tries to use as&nbsp;
proof that Nica is not crazy on November&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:31.920 --> 00:05:36.080
1st, 2013. He’s not successful, but he&nbsp;
publishes the video online that same day.

00:05:36.880 --> 00:05:38.240
– Wait a minute, there’s two of them?

00:05:38.240 --> 00:05:42.480
– Yes, there are multiple Chuckys already. So&nbsp;
another one of them is sent to attack Andy at his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:42.480 --> 00:05:47.120
apartment. This is the epilogue of Curse - stated&nbsp;
to be 6 months after Nica’s trial. That puts it&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:47.120 --> 00:05:51.760
in late October or early November. Actually, we&nbsp;
know it’s early November, because of this line.

00:05:51.760 --> 00:05:53.600
– Yeah, I’m definitely coming&nbsp;
for my birthday tomorrow.

00:05:53.600 --> 00:05:57.120
Which means the date is November&nbsp;
8th, 2013, the day before Andy’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:57.120 --> 00:06:01.518
25th birthday. The next action would&nbsp;
go down almost four years after this.

00:06:01.628 --> 00:06:03.628
(cinematic impact)

00:06:06.743 --> 00:06:10.324
(eerie drone)

00:06:10.560 --> 00:06:13.600
Nearly four years go by before&nbsp;
the main events of Cult of Chucky.

00:06:14.800 --> 00:06:18.640
– [Dr. Foley] In the past four years you’ve had to&nbsp;
accept some hard truths about yourself.

00:06:18.640 --> 00:06:22.480
– Chucky starts taking victims at&nbsp;
the asylum on January 24th, 2017,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:22.480 --> 00:06:26.400
because we see the date listed on this Perez&nbsp;
Hilton article. Some of the top related stories&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:26.400 --> 00:06:31.360
during articles in Cult are about Obamacare and the&nbsp;
Trump Wall, so January 2017 seems accurate,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:31.360 --> 00:06:35.760
since this was not long before Obama’s term&nbsp;
as US president ended and Trump’s term began.

00:06:35.760 --> 00:06:39.840
Finally that brings us to Chucky Season 1.&nbsp;
Some people have suggested that this takes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:39.840 --> 00:06:44.800
place right after Cult of Chucky, in 2017,&nbsp;
however, it actually takes place in 2021,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:44.800 --> 00:06:48.880
and I have plenty of proof. My only note is&nbsp;
that, like many TV shows made in the 20s,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:48.880 --> 00:06:53.040
this seems to take place in a world where&nbsp;
COVID-19 never happened. Please take me there.

00:06:53.040 --> 00:06:56.880
Chucky first re-emerges in Hackensack in&nbsp;
Mid-March, which we can see is where the murder&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:56.880 --> 00:07:01.807
rate spikes on this graph. This has gotta be March&nbsp;
2021, because Devon says

00:07:01.807 --> 00:07:03.000
– [Devon] in the past year alone,

00:07:03.000 --> 00:07:05.434
our murder rate has spiked 25%.

00:07:05.434 --> 00:07:07.840
– But the&nbsp;
series doesn’t start until October 18th,

00:07:07.840 --> 00:07:11.120
a date we can derive from the fact that&nbsp;
Lucas Wheeler’s headstone lists his death&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:11.120 --> 00:07:15.072
as October 19th 2021, and we first meet him one day before that.

00:07:15.072 --> 00:07:17.520
It’s stated that&nbsp;
Jake misses a week of school after this.

00:07:17.520 --> 00:07:21.120
In episode 2, a title card says&nbsp;
Hackensack Present Day. The episode&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:21.120 --> 00:07:25.200
takes place on Halloween, and indeed it&nbsp;
did come out on the week of Halloween in 2021.

00:07:25.200 --> 00:07:29.120
That means episode 3, which would be&nbsp;
the day after, is set on November 1st.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:29.120 --> 00:07:32.800
The song that they listen to at Lexi’s&nbsp;
silent disco party came out in 2020,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:32.800 --> 00:07:35.920
so it can’t still be 2017.&nbsp;
The song wasn’t out yet.

00:07:35.920 --> 00:07:39.120
Episode 4 looks like it is the next&nbsp;
morning: November 2nd. In this one,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:39.120 --> 00:07:42.880
Chucky refers to Lexi as a Karen on training&nbsp;
wheels. Even though COVID didn’t happen in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:42.880 --> 00:07:46.320
this universe, I’m still gonna assume that&nbsp;
the Karens made themselves known in 2020.

00:07:46.320 --> 00:07:50.080
The confusion come about in Episode&nbsp;
5. Nica, after being possessed by&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:50.080 --> 00:07:53.600
the soul of Charles Lee Ray, regains&nbsp;
control of her body and asks his guy&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:53.600 --> 00:07:56.552
for the date. He tells her it’s November&nbsp;
8th, and she says...

00:07:56.552 --> 00:07:57.944
– It’s been 2 weeks.

00:07:58.000 --> 00:08:01.840
– This led some people to believe that&nbsp;
Chucky Season 1 takes place in 2017,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:01.840 --> 00:08:06.400
2 weeks after Cult of Chucky. However, that&nbsp;
doesn’t make sense. November does not take&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:06.400 --> 00:08:10.160
place 2 weeks after January. What most&nbsp;
likely happened, is that Nica is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:10.160 --> 00:08:14.240
basically asleep whenever Chucky is in control&nbsp;
of her body. She might have temporarily gotten&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:14.240 --> 00:08:20.000
control back in October 2017, or October 2018,&nbsp;
19, or 20, it doesn’t really matter. And then&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:20.000 --> 00:08:24.800
Chucky was in control for one or more years after&nbsp;
that. When Nica regained control on November 8th&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:24.800 --> 00:08:28.800
2021, she assumed that only 2 weeks had&nbsp;
passed when it had actually been years.

00:08:28.800 --> 00:08:30.800
If you need any more proof that it’s 2021,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:30.800 --> 00:08:33.760
look at this conversation that Jake&nbsp;
and Devon have about horror movies.

00:08:33.760 --> 00:08:36.320
– [Devon] Favorite final girl?
– [Jake] Laurie Strode! Hands down.&nbsp;

00:08:36.320 --> 00:08:38.000
– Jamie Lee’s gonna&nbsp;
win the Saturn this year.&nbsp;

00:08:38.000 --> 00:08:40.640
– Dude she’s gonna win&nbsp;
an Oscar, she’s magnificent.

00:08:40.640 --> 00:08:43.520
– They must be talking about&nbsp;
Halloween Kills from 2021,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:43.520 --> 00:08:46.720
because Jamie Lee Curtis was&nbsp;
not in any movies in 2017.

00:08:46.720 --> 00:08:50.320
The rest of the series just takes place in&nbsp;
mid-November. We don’t know the exact date,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:50.320 --> 00:08:52.640
but in Episode 6, there’s an&nbsp;
intro scene, which is the first&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:52.640 --> 00:08:56.560
time we see Andy Barclay in the show. It&nbsp;
appears to happen right after Episode 5,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:56.560 --> 00:09:00.320
which would mean that Andy is reintroduced&nbsp;
on his birthday again, which is kind of fun.

00:09:00.320 --> 00:09:04.400
The last thing to figure out is how&nbsp;
long Andy was in captivity after Cult.

00:09:04.400 --> 00:09:08.160
– [Devon] I Googled Andy Barclay and got an article&nbsp;
from 2 weeks ago. Violent patient escapes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:08.160 --> 00:09:10.560
Harrogate Psychiatric Hospital. Manhunt underway.

00:09:10.560 --> 00:09:15.040
That would mean that Andy didn’t escape until&nbsp;
October 25th, 2021. So he was actually in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:15.040 --> 00:09:19.520
Harrogate for almost 5 years. However,&nbsp;
in the same episode, Jake says this.

00:09:19.520 --> 00:09:23.280
– I got a call from Rhode Island about&nbsp;
a month ago. It must be Andy Barclay.

00:09:23.280 --> 00:09:25.200
– We saw that phone call in episode 1,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:25.200 --> 00:09:29.680
meaning that it happened on October 19th,&nbsp;
six days before Andy supposedly escaped.

00:09:29.680 --> 00:09:33.280
Andy is a pretty crafty guy. And the&nbsp;
hospital was left very short staffed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:33.280 --> 00:09:37.280
after the events of Cult. I think what&nbsp;
happened here was Andy escaped a while ago.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:37.280 --> 00:09:41.840
They just didn’t realize he escaped until much&nbsp;
later. He might have escaped the previous winter,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:41.840 --> 00:09:45.600
because the epilogue of Cult shows Kyle, in&nbsp;
the winter, putting away the Chucky head at&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:45.600 --> 00:09:50.000
Andy’s request. We can assume it took some time&nbsp;
for Andy and Kyle to meet up again after that.

00:09:50.000 --> 00:09:52.960
I don’t know how Andy pulled off&nbsp;
this escape without them realizing,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:52.960 --> 00:09:56.640
but he probably tricked one of the new&nbsp;
incoming patients into pretending to be him&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:56.640 --> 00:09:59.920
and took advantage of a new staff member&nbsp;
that didn’t know names and faces yet.

00:09:59.920 --> 00:10:04.080
So I just wanted to make this video to clarify&nbsp;
my current views on the Chucky timeline before&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:04.080 --> 00:10:07.920
I start making any more Chucky Horror History&nbsp;
episodes, so I can focus more on the character&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:07.920 --> 00:10:11.440
analysis when I do make those. I am getting&nbsp;
eye surgery soon, that’s why I’m wearing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:11.440 --> 00:10:15.040
glasses lately. I’m gonna try not to miss&nbsp;
a week, but if I do, that’s probably why.

00:10:15.040 --> 00:10:19.120
If this ends up being my last video ever,&nbsp;
then I guess I got Final Destination 5’d.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:19.120 --> 00:10:24.000
But for the event that doesn’t happen, please&nbsp;
subscribe to CZsWorld for new horrors every week,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:24.000 --> 00:10:26.320
ring the deathbell and set&nbsp;
it to all notifications,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:26.320 --> 00:10:30.000
and I’ll see you in the next&nbsp;
one assuming we both survive.

00:10:30.180 --> 00:10:32.180
(spooky dance music)

